<title>USA: Chemfab adds 100,000 shares to buyback plan.</title>
<headline>Chemfab adds 100,000 shares to buyback plan.</headline>
<dateline>MERRIMACK, N.H. 1997-05-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Chemfab Inc, a maker of polymer-based engineered products, said Wednesday its board has authorized the repurchase of an additional 100,000 of the company's common shares for the fiscal year ending June 30.</p>
<p>The shares are in addition to the 400,000 shares the board had authorized for buyback for the current fiscal year.  The 400,000 shares had been repurchased for the year, the company said.</p>
<p>In the future, the annual 400,000-share-repurchase limit will apply, it said.</p>
</text>
